WEBVTT

01:26.440 --> 01:29.760
[Glory]

01:30.760 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 21]

01:46.479 --> 01:48.200
Thank you for your help, Lady Yunshu,

01:48.200 --> 01:49.530
for giving me this idea.

01:50.039 --> 01:51.710
Brand Madam Yang as a prostitute

01:51.710 --> 01:53.640
makes her identity impossible to verify.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.710
Even her testimony

01:55.080 --> 01:56.759
was no longer believed by anyone in court.

01:56.759 --> 01:58.160
Mr. Yang, you flatter me.

01:59.190 --> 01:59.950
I merely asked you

01:59.950 --> 02:01.040
to find her a cover.

02:01.480 --> 02:02.680
Never did I expect you

02:02.790 --> 02:03.400
to consign her

02:03.400 --> 02:04.930
to such a shameful station.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.760
Such a wicked scheme

02:07.230 --> 02:09.000
requires a vicious mind.

02:11.330 --> 02:13.190
For the safety of our Yang family,

02:13.710 --> 02:15.630
we have no choice
but to sacrifice her alone.

02:15.630 --> 02:17.800
They all say Miss Rong is peerless in wit,

02:17.800 --> 02:19.840
but in my view, it's merely a false rumor.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.520
Those who keep a low profile

02:21.800 --> 02:23.260
are the truly clever ones.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.280
I can never thank you enough.

02:25.920 --> 02:27.670
Please accept this pearl.

02:29.910 --> 02:31.310
Once the case is settled,

02:31.710 --> 02:33.440
I shall reward you handsomely.

02:46.030 --> 02:47.030
A luminous pearl?

02:52.710 --> 02:55.000
Giving a luminous pearl to a blind person?

02:55.000 --> 02:56.240
How ridiculous.

02:57.560 --> 02:58.120
Keep it.

02:58.870 --> 02:59.520
My Lady.

03:00.000 --> 03:02.030
Why did you help this villain?

03:08.680 --> 03:09.360
Do you know what people outside

03:09.360 --> 03:10.360
have been saying?

03:10.920 --> 03:11.650
They say that

03:11.680 --> 03:13.520
Wei Kejian has already confessed in court,

03:13.520 --> 03:14.750
so that woman claiming to be Madam Yang

03:14.750 --> 03:15.880
must be an impostor.

03:16.079 --> 03:17.590
They also say she was
bribed by the Wei family

03:17.590 --> 03:19.120
just to frame the Yang family.

03:19.120 --> 03:20.430
With the case in such chaos,

03:20.430 --> 03:21.630
how can it be settled?

03:22.829 --> 03:23.710
You shouldn't have

03:23.710 --> 03:24.970
traded Qing Yun for me.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.360
If we had caught Xu Song

03:26.360 --> 03:28.520
with evidence of plotting
against the imperial envoy,

03:28.520 --> 03:29.920
he wouldn't be meddling.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.750
So this is the home of Wei Laowu?

03:33.750 --> 03:35.150
He's been dead for years,

03:35.470 --> 03:37.329
so there's no one left to testify.

03:40.840 --> 03:44.190
Our ancestral medical skills
cure every illness.

03:44.680 --> 03:46.520
Better than Hua Tuo reborn,

03:46.710 --> 03:48.750
and greater than Bian Que revived.

03:48.880 --> 03:52.840
Even the most stubborn disease
vanishes at a single touch.

03:53.030 --> 03:53.630
Master.

03:54.640 --> 03:56.079
My grandmother is blind.

03:56.100 --> 03:57.100
Can you treat her?

03:58.870 --> 04:00.270
We're starving to death.

04:00.310 --> 04:02.560
How could we afford medicine?

04:03.080 --> 04:04.520
Just leave.

04:04.910 --> 04:06.150
Even a miracle elixir

04:06.150 --> 04:08.150
cannot cure poverty or starvation.

04:08.430 --> 04:09.960
Old Madam, your face is pale

04:10.000 --> 04:11.400
and your lips are purple.

04:11.400 --> 04:13.670
This is caused by
a deficiency of qi and blood,

04:13.670 --> 04:14.930
and a lack of heart yin.

04:22.750 --> 04:23.810
Let me examine you.

04:25.680 --> 04:27.120
To be honest with you, Old Madam,

04:27.120 --> 04:28.600
my master is a man of virtue

04:28.620 --> 04:29.500
and charity.

04:29.550 --> 04:31.310
For poor families, he charges
only for the medicine

04:31.310 --> 04:32.720
and never for his consultation.

04:32.720 --> 04:33.780
Let him take a look.

04:46.159 --> 04:48.159
Do you often suffer
from persistent coughing

04:48.159 --> 04:49.420
and sleepless nights?

04:49.830 --> 04:51.159
Do you also experience chest tightness,
shortness of breath,

04:51.159 --> 04:52.040
and chest pain?

04:55.590 --> 04:57.120
This illness isn't recent.

04:57.510 --> 04:59.970
You must have experienced some heartbreak.

05:05.000 --> 05:07.040
To cure an illness,
the remedy must fit the cause.

05:07.040 --> 05:08.680
Your sickness is of the heart.

05:08.680 --> 05:09.950
If there's anything weighing on you,

05:09.950 --> 05:10.920
you can tell us.

05:11.390 --> 05:13.320
Perhaps we can help ease your mind.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.270
You truly have insight, Master.

05:19.750 --> 05:21.680
In all my many years,

05:22.750 --> 05:24.720
I had only one son.

05:25.160 --> 05:27.560
And now he's gone,

05:28.770 --> 05:31.530
how could I not be heartbroken?

05:36.830 --> 05:38.760
I'm sorry for your loss, Old Madam.

05:38.830 --> 05:40.120
A deficiency of heart yin

05:40.120 --> 05:41.560
is caused not only by excessive sorrow,

05:41.560 --> 05:43.420
but also by living in a damp place.

05:44.430 --> 05:46.360
Please allow me to take a look inside.

05:46.360 --> 05:47.870
Even if you can't afford medicine,

05:47.870 --> 05:48.980
a few acupuncture treatments

05:48.980 --> 05:49.950
may help ease the pain

05:49.950 --> 05:50.750
in your heart.

05:51.600 --> 05:53.060
Our home is bare and empty,

05:53.390 --> 05:55.120
with only a roof over our heads.

05:55.630 --> 05:57.920
Even thieves would avoid this place.

05:58.270 --> 06:00.470
I'm grateful that you do not disdain it.

06:00.710 --> 06:02.120
Please come in and sit.

06:02.520 --> 06:03.000
Okay.

06:09.390 --> 06:11.250
The officials came to arrest him,

06:11.310 --> 06:13.310
yet they didn't say
what crime he'd committed,

06:13.310 --> 06:14.840
nor offer any explanation.

06:16.870 --> 06:18.800
Back then, we went to the Wei family

06:19.240 --> 06:21.300
to borrow grain because we were poor.

06:21.750 --> 06:24.280
When we heard that
the bride had gone missing,

06:24.630 --> 06:26.360
my kindhearted son

06:26.720 --> 06:28.310
went to help find her.

06:29.270 --> 06:31.070
After three days and nights,

06:31.950 --> 06:34.320
he brought back
no more than three dou of rice

06:34.320 --> 06:35.790
and fifty wen

06:36.750 --> 06:39.070
as a token of thanks from the Wei family.

06:46.140 --> 06:47.800
Please don't grieve too much.

06:47.900 --> 06:49.360
I'll come to see you again.

06:50.030 --> 06:50.680
Thank you.

07:08.160 --> 07:08.680
Wait.

07:11.390 --> 07:11.950
What?

07:15.680 --> 07:17.310
This is my grandmother's cane.

07:17.310 --> 07:18.750
How did it end up here?

07:19.300 --> 07:21.890
My cane is right here.

07:22.820 --> 07:24.790
Where did you get that firewood?

07:25.510 --> 07:26.170
These days,

07:26.260 --> 07:28.190
I've been grinding tofu for Mrs. Gao,

07:28.190 --> 07:29.750
with no time to gather firewood.

07:29.750 --> 07:31.480
I got this from the pile

07:31.480 --> 07:33.120
of decayed wood at the old house.

07:33.120 --> 07:34.980
Who used to live in that old house?

07:35.310 --> 07:36.240
My father.

07:37.030 --> 07:37.710
Wei Ming?

07:45.320 --> 07:48.170
[Linji Prefectural Office]

07:47.000 --> 07:48.130
Bring in Wei Kejian.

07:55.120 --> 07:55.780
Wei Kejian.

07:56.450 --> 07:58.510
You admitted killing Madam Yang yourself.

07:58.510 --> 07:59.720
And your relatives Wei Ming and Wei Laowu

07:59.720 --> 08:01.430
helped you carry and bury the body.

08:01.430 --> 08:02.690
So where was it buried?

08:04.270 --> 08:06.070
What can that fool possibly say?

08:06.510 --> 08:07.120
At this rate,

08:07.120 --> 08:08.510
how can the case ever be resolved?

08:08.510 --> 08:09.310
Indeed.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.070
He is sometimes clear-headed,

08:11.070 --> 08:12.200
sometimes muddled.

08:12.630 --> 08:13.510
And it just so happens that

08:13.510 --> 08:15.070
today is one of his muddled days.

08:15.070 --> 08:16.400
Let me explain instead.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.560
The real Madam Yang's body

08:19.560 --> 08:20.830
was long ago unearthed,

08:20.830 --> 08:22.690
at the foot of Qingfeng Mountain.

08:23.270 --> 08:25.510
The Wei family's tea plantation
is also on Qingfeng Mountain,

08:25.510 --> 08:27.640
so it makes perfect sense that Wei Kejian

08:27.640 --> 08:29.630
would choose this place to bury the body.

08:29.630 --> 08:30.240
Is that so?

08:31.210 --> 08:33.150
The Wei family does not
live deep in the mountains.

08:33.150 --> 08:35.080
He killed and buried the body
in the middle of the night.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.080
Are all the nearby households

08:36.080 --> 08:37.150
clay dolls,

08:37.150 --> 08:38.010
deaf and blind,

08:38.320 --> 08:39.360
that none of them

08:39.360 --> 08:40.150
noticed?

08:40.669 --> 08:42.090
Do you think that's possible, Lord Xu?

08:42.090 --> 08:44.550
Have you never
examined the case files, Lord Lu?

08:44.550 --> 08:46.770
It was a dark and rainy night.

08:47.240 --> 08:49.360
The neighbors had no idea
of his crime.

08:49.360 --> 08:51.150
Moreover, Wei Laowu and Wei Ming

08:51.150 --> 08:52.720
used the pretext of transporting tea bags

08:52.720 --> 08:53.650
to cover for him.

08:53.720 --> 08:55.390
Who would suspect anything?

08:56.910 --> 08:58.960
Bring in Wei Laowu's mother, Madam Chang,

08:58.960 --> 09:00.620
and his daughter Wei Miao'er.

09:02.680 --> 09:03.880
Who are these people?

09:05.440 --> 09:06.790
Are there any other witnesses?

09:06.790 --> 09:07.720
Who are they?

09:07.720 --> 09:08.240
She's blind.

09:08.240 --> 09:09.300
Why bring her here?

09:09.910 --> 09:10.980
A blind old woman

09:11.840 --> 09:12.770
and a young girl?

09:16.940 --> 09:18.960
Lord Xu, these are Wei Laowu's

09:18.960 --> 09:20.160
mother and daughter.

09:20.320 --> 09:22.720
Do you notice anything unusual about them?

09:22.720 --> 09:24.790
A blind woman and a young girl.

09:25.280 --> 09:26.810
What's unusual about that?

09:27.750 --> 09:28.480
Madam Chang.

09:29.390 --> 09:31.120
During my undercover investigation,

09:31.120 --> 09:32.600
I found Wei Laowu's

09:32.600 --> 09:34.060
walking cane at your home.

09:34.860 --> 09:35.990
Do you bring it here?

09:36.510 --> 09:37.720
Yes, I do.

09:38.030 --> 09:39.530
Miao, present it.

09:43.900 --> 09:44.380
My Lord.

09:47.870 --> 09:48.600
No need.

09:49.790 --> 09:51.000
Lord Lu, so you're saying

09:51.000 --> 09:52.720
Wei Laowu was a cripple.

09:53.080 --> 09:54.840
Since he could come to borrow grain,

09:54.840 --> 09:56.970
that proves he had no trouble walking.

09:57.200 --> 09:58.670
But who ever said a cripple

09:58.690 --> 10:00.890
couldn't dig the ground and bury a body?

10:01.060 --> 10:02.240
Lord Xu, please look closely

10:02.240 --> 10:03.450
at this old woman and the young girl.

10:03.450 --> 10:04.750
They both have an internal eye disorder

10:04.750 --> 10:06.130
that clouds their vision.

10:06.130 --> 10:08.150
Although they have eyeballs,
they can hardly perceive anything,

10:08.150 --> 10:09.320
only light and dark.

10:10.080 --> 10:12.000
The girl here is no more
than 13 years old.

10:12.000 --> 10:13.530
She can see in bright light,

10:13.710 --> 10:15.510
but in dim light her sight fails.

10:15.900 --> 10:16.600
In Arcane Essentials
from the Imeperial Library,

10:16.600 --> 10:17.860
this disease is called

10:17.910 --> 10:19.440
cerebral night blindness.

10:20.260 --> 10:22.510
Three generations of this family
suffer from this ailment.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.240
Wei Laowu

10:23.240 --> 10:24.770
wasn't severely affected.

10:25.170 --> 10:27.010
In daily life, he could
see unclearly

10:27.010 --> 10:28.470
but still managed to work.

10:28.740 --> 10:30.270
So he never revealed it to others,

10:30.270 --> 10:32.200
fearing it might disrupt his livelihood.

10:32.200 --> 10:34.120
But as you, Lord Xu, said,

10:34.480 --> 10:36.410
it was dark, and it rained heavily.

10:36.870 --> 10:38.330
Wei Laowu could barely see

10:38.440 --> 10:39.840
and had to rely on his walking stick.

10:39.840 --> 10:40.910
How could he possibly carry a corpse

10:40.910 --> 10:41.790
and bury it?

10:43.630 --> 10:46.080
The Wei family had
servants and neighbors nearby.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.830
Why would Wei Kejian go so far

10:47.850 --> 10:49.110
to involve outsiders?

10:49.630 --> 10:50.510
Wei Laowu had

10:50.790 --> 10:52.750
an elderly mother
and a young child to care for.

10:52.750 --> 10:53.750
For a mere sack of grain

10:53.750 --> 10:54.550
and fifty wen,

10:55.000 --> 10:55.960
how could he risk his life

10:55.960 --> 10:57.550
to carry and bury a body for someone else?

10:57.550 --> 10:59.320
Clearly, it's all nonsense.

11:00.270 --> 11:01.990
Anyone who dares to speak
such madness in this court again

11:01.990 --> 11:03.520
will be beaten with the rod.

11:05.410 --> 11:06.390
Indeed.

11:06.670 --> 11:07.270
That fool

11:07.270 --> 11:09.400
must have been instigated by someone.

11:09.790 --> 11:12.240
This old woman and
the young girl are truly pitiful.

11:12.240 --> 11:13.120
Take them away.

11:21.000 --> 11:23.060
Bring in Yang Jisheng and Madam Yang.

11:23.650 --> 11:25.510
Is there really something wrong?

11:25.870 --> 11:27.030
Is this for real?

11:33.840 --> 11:35.300
Bring the brushes and ink.

11:40.750 --> 11:41.270
Write.

11:45.790 --> 11:46.750
On your knees.

11:51.530 --> 11:53.400
Madam Yang, sit.

12:01.510 --> 12:03.310
I won't ask about anything else.

12:03.360 --> 12:04.760
I only have one question.

12:04.790 --> 12:06.320
I've heard that Master Yang

12:06.320 --> 12:07.520
was often ill in life.

12:07.720 --> 12:09.550
Which pharmacy supplied his medicine,

12:09.550 --> 12:11.320
and what prescriptions were used?

12:11.320 --> 12:12.450
Write them all down.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.240
Young Master.

12:34.750 --> 12:36.350
What's going on in the court?

12:38.630 --> 12:39.670
What on earth

12:39.790 --> 12:40.790
is Lu Jiang up to?

13:02.960 --> 13:03.720
My Lord, you must

13:03.720 --> 13:05.380
have heard some false rumors.

13:05.440 --> 13:07.300
Father was always in good health.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.670
Only with age did he experience

13:08.670 --> 13:10.040
some aches in his back and legs,

13:10.040 --> 13:11.390
feel occasional heat, and irritability.

13:11.390 --> 13:12.600
The medicine he took was Kanli Pills,

13:12.600 --> 13:13.930
prepared by Yixin Hall.

13:14.120 --> 13:15.910
It was the Kanli Pills you sent.

13:17.120 --> 13:18.480
Father took them for less than a month

13:18.480 --> 13:19.840
and developed high fever

13:19.840 --> 13:21.030
and swelling pain in his legs.

13:21.030 --> 13:23.550
Only then did we realize that Huangbo
and Zhimu, while boosting vitality,

13:23.550 --> 13:25.200
could deplete the liver and kidneys.

13:25.200 --> 13:26.600
He was thus given Bu Zhong Yi Qi Tang

13:26.600 --> 13:27.600
in the morning,

13:27.720 --> 13:30.050
and Six-Flavor Rehmannia pills at night.

13:33.000 --> 13:33.800
Yang Jisheng.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.670
This is the medical record
for your father,

13:35.670 --> 13:37.480
personally written by
the renowned physician

13:37.480 --> 13:38.810
Gao Shuwei of Anle Hall.

13:43.030 --> 13:44.870
The Wei family is eager
to overturn the case,

13:44.870 --> 13:46.080
how do you know
they wouldn't bribe a physician

13:46.080 --> 13:47.160
to give false testimony?

13:47.160 --> 13:48.910
How would the Wei family know that

13:48.910 --> 13:49.720
Father grew strong and vigorous

13:49.720 --> 13:51.390
after taking the medicine

13:51.390 --> 13:52.150
of Physician Gao,

13:52.150 --> 13:52.960
and fathered an illegitimate brother

13:52.960 --> 13:53.790
for you?

13:54.200 --> 13:55.680
How would the Wei family know that,

13:55.680 --> 13:57.480
fearing your half-brother
would reduce the inheritance,

13:57.480 --> 13:59.340
you secretly sent him to a temple?

13:59.660 --> 14:01.190
And how would they know that

14:01.440 --> 14:03.390
your father died
with his eyes open in anger,

14:03.390 --> 14:05.640
that he tore
the jade pendant from your waist,

14:05.640 --> 14:07.390
and that in seizing the pendant,

14:07.390 --> 14:09.520
you broke the fingers of the deceased?

14:10.000 --> 14:11.330
Such unfilial conduct!

14:11.480 --> 14:12.750
He is less than a beast,

14:13.440 --> 14:14.510
doing such a thing

14:14.790 --> 14:15.790
to his own father!

14:16.230 --> 14:17.160
How cruel!

14:17.790 --> 14:18.320
My Lord.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.440
Before the Wei family incident,

14:20.440 --> 14:21.600
I went to the temple every year

14:21.600 --> 14:22.870
to offer winter clothes and cakes.

14:22.870 --> 14:24.150
Just go to Jingguang Temple

14:24.150 --> 14:25.480
outside Linji and investigate.

14:25.480 --> 14:26.610
See if he can deny it!

14:27.240 --> 14:28.040
Yang Jisheng!

14:28.240 --> 14:29.880
She spoke of
the Yang family's private affairs

14:29.880 --> 14:31.220
that no outsider could possibly know.

14:31.220 --> 14:33.550
Do you still dare say
she isn't Madam Yang?

14:35.750 --> 14:36.550
Lord Lu.

14:36.910 --> 14:38.840
No wall is completely sealed,

14:39.390 --> 14:41.520
and no woman can keep secrets forever.

14:41.870 --> 14:44.070
Madam Yang married into the Wei family,

14:44.120 --> 14:47.360
and might have revealed secrets
during intimate moments with her husband.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.550
Who can say for sure?

14:50.440 --> 14:52.970
Miss Rong personally
identified her before.

14:53.510 --> 14:55.360
Could she be lying as well?

15:11.030 --> 15:13.630
Miss Rong, forgive me
for speaking out of turn.

15:14.140 --> 15:14.720
Before we left,

15:14.720 --> 15:16.180
Lady Rong repeatedly said

15:16.390 --> 15:17.790
that no matter how serious the matter is,

15:17.790 --> 15:19.600
one must not act beyond the Rong family.

15:19.600 --> 15:20.550
As for what to do,

15:21.150 --> 15:23.120
you must have your own judgment.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.130
Don't follow me.

15:37.360 --> 15:38.620
Bring in Rong Shanbao.

15:42.550 --> 15:44.080
Why is Miss Rong here again?

15:56.360 --> 15:57.160
Rong Shanbao.

15:57.630 --> 15:59.630
Today, I ask you in all seriousness.

16:00.480 --> 16:01.550
Do you truly not recognize

16:01.550 --> 16:03.030
the identity of this woman?

16:03.030 --> 16:04.160
I've already stated

16:04.240 --> 16:06.040
everything in court yesterday.

16:06.320 --> 16:08.050
There's no need to ask me again.

16:08.390 --> 16:10.190
You call her your foster mother,

16:10.200 --> 16:12.240
and that binds you
by mother-daughter ties.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.480
How can you bear to have her

16:13.480 --> 16:14.880
labeled as a prostitute?

16:16.240 --> 16:18.500
If you mean to take the Wei family's side,

16:18.720 --> 16:20.180
I have nothing more to say.

16:24.030 --> 16:24.600
Good.

16:25.990 --> 16:27.720
Since you don't recognize her,

16:27.750 --> 16:30.150
someone from the Rong family will testify.

16:30.810 --> 16:32.870
Bring in Rong Yunyin and Rong Yunwan.

16:33.870 --> 16:34.440
My Lord.

16:35.150 --> 16:36.810
Yunwan is naturally foolish.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.560
How could she possibly testify in court?

16:38.560 --> 16:40.490
Even a madman can testify in court.

16:40.910 --> 16:43.170
Lady Yunwan has the innocence of a child,

16:43.520 --> 16:45.270
incapable of fabricating lies.

16:45.270 --> 16:46.240
Isn't she the most

16:46.240 --> 16:47.840
honest witness in the world?

16:48.510 --> 16:49.240
Bring her in.

16:57.630 --> 16:59.760
This is Lady Yunwan of the Rong family.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.120
How is she a simpleton?

17:01.120 --> 17:02.180
She is a simpleton.

17:07.599 --> 17:08.510
Ms. Liang.

17:10.359 --> 17:10.950
Wanwan.

17:22.270 --> 17:22.960
Lord Lu.

17:23.640 --> 17:25.170
She's clearly a simpleton.

17:25.660 --> 17:27.920
What testimony could she possibly give?

17:28.400 --> 17:30.270
My Lord, please allow me to explain.

17:30.270 --> 17:31.790
After Madam Yang came to our family,

17:31.790 --> 17:33.480
she became Yunwan's maid,

17:33.920 --> 17:35.250
raised her personally,

17:35.550 --> 17:36.810
and never left her side

17:37.000 --> 17:38.260
for more than a decade.

17:38.790 --> 17:40.240
Everyone in our Rong family

17:40.240 --> 17:41.590
calls her Ms. Liang.

17:44.270 --> 17:44.750
My Lord.

17:45.460 --> 17:46.330
Rong Yunyin

17:46.350 --> 17:48.000
made a grave mistake
while tending the plantation

17:48.000 --> 17:49.750
and was punished by working
on the tea mountains.

17:49.750 --> 17:51.510
She harbors resentment
toward the Rong family,

17:51.510 --> 17:53.270
so her testimony is not credible.

17:53.270 --> 17:55.480
Yunwan's is mentally confused.

17:55.790 --> 17:58.240
She cannot even recognize people
during her episodes.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.000
How could she possibly distinguish

17:59.000 --> 18:00.520
between Ms. Liang and the others?

18:00.520 --> 18:01.850
Shanbao, you're lying.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.030
I can recognize them clearly.

18:03.030 --> 18:04.230
I can tell them apart.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.880
See, see!

18:16.230 --> 18:17.230
I was only seven

18:17.250 --> 18:18.960
when Ms. Liang taught me to paint.

18:18.960 --> 18:19.880
She painted me

18:19.900 --> 18:21.100
and herself too.

18:23.880 --> 18:24.940
Where is Ms. Liang?

18:34.640 --> 18:35.200
Look.

18:36.720 --> 18:38.320
Shanbao, you're in here too.

18:39.370 --> 18:41.310
Shanbao, you told me

18:41.310 --> 18:43.110
that children should never lie.

18:43.590 --> 18:46.110
You lied to me. You're a liar!

18:57.790 --> 18:58.400
Wanwan.

19:03.070 --> 19:03.680
For ten years,

19:03.680 --> 19:05.480
every painting has been signed.

19:06.160 --> 19:08.190
Compare the signatures
with Madam Yang's handwriting,

19:08.190 --> 19:10.790
and you'll see that
Rong Shanbao's words are lies.

19:10.790 --> 19:13.030
Ms. Liang is Madam Yang.

19:14.030 --> 19:15.510
That's right.

19:17.160 --> 19:19.890
Bring the paintings
and have them compared here.

19:20.240 --> 19:20.720
Yes.

19:31.690 --> 19:33.190
Madam Yang, stop!

19:44.400 --> 19:45.350
My Lord, My Lord!

19:45.580 --> 19:46.690
I had nowhere to go

19:47.000 --> 19:48.550
and was kindly
taken in by the Rong family.

19:48.550 --> 19:50.590
It was my greed that made me

19:51.030 --> 19:52.880
falsely claim to
be Madam Yang and extort money.

19:52.880 --> 19:53.720
I confess my crime.

19:53.720 --> 19:55.110
I beg you to consider my circumstances

19:55.110 --> 19:56.910
and not implicate the innocent.

20:08.030 --> 20:10.030
My Lords, you've witnessed it clearly.

20:10.030 --> 20:11.400
She confessed herself!

20:11.960 --> 20:12.760
What did I say?

20:13.070 --> 20:15.000
She is not Madam Yang at all!

20:15.510 --> 20:16.970
She is a lowly prostitute,

20:17.240 --> 20:18.720
a fraudulent whore!

20:22.110 --> 20:23.750
Shanbao! Shanbao!

20:23.750 --> 20:24.720
Shanbao!

20:26.140 --> 20:28.900
Lord Lu, you are still young

20:29.160 --> 20:30.660
and eager to solve the case for merit,

20:30.660 --> 20:32.260
which is why you were misled.

20:32.720 --> 20:35.160
I will personally submit a report to
the Ministry of Justice,

20:35.160 --> 20:36.920
to uphold the original verdict.

20:36.920 --> 20:39.200
As for this fake Madam Yang,
who slandered others,

20:39.200 --> 20:41.440
guards, give her forty strokes first!

20:42.780 --> 20:44.780
She hasn't falsely accused anyone.

20:46.540 --> 20:47.870
She is Madam Yang.

20:51.440 --> 20:53.370
How does she become Madam Yang now?

20:55.680 --> 20:57.340
Whose word should we believe?

21:00.760 --> 21:01.760
In this court,

21:01.780 --> 21:03.400
how dare you contradict yourself

21:03.400 --> 21:05.070
with such reckless accusations!

21:05.070 --> 21:06.600
You claim she is Madam Yang.

21:08.280 --> 21:10.390
Are you saying the Rong family admits

21:10.410 --> 21:12.250
to harboring a criminal?

21:13.400 --> 21:15.030
My Lord, she is Madam Yang,

21:15.830 --> 21:17.070
Wei Kejian's wife,

21:17.240 --> 21:18.570
Yang Jisheng's sister,

21:18.790 --> 21:19.750
and the only reliable witness

21:19.750 --> 21:21.350
in the Wei family's old case.

21:21.640 --> 21:22.670
Ten years ago,

21:23.030 --> 21:24.720
she wanted to come forward as a witness.

21:24.720 --> 21:25.920
But being powerless,

21:26.110 --> 21:28.200
she nearly lost her life
in the Yang family.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.730
When her life was in danger,

21:29.960 --> 21:32.000
the Rong Family
sheltered her out of kindness,

21:32.000 --> 21:33.530
preserving her as a witness

21:33.880 --> 21:35.280
until the day should come

21:36.680 --> 21:38.680
when a worthy official would arrive

21:38.880 --> 21:40.790
to bring justice to light,

21:41.270 --> 21:42.930
and vindicate the Wei family.

21:43.400 --> 21:46.110
Before this, I was
threatened by officials,

21:46.750 --> 21:48.750
and dared not present the evidence.

21:48.920 --> 21:49.480
Lord Lu.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.160
I have Madam Yang's

21:51.590 --> 21:53.200
blood-stained garment from back then.

21:53.200 --> 21:55.750
And the renowned physician
Zhao Shijing can also testify.

21:55.750 --> 21:57.790
The servant hidden in
the Rong family for ten years

21:57.790 --> 21:58.850
is indeed Yang Yun.

21:59.070 --> 22:00.600
This is the absolute truth.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.030
What?

22:02.640 --> 22:03.350
How can it be true at one moment

22:03.350 --> 22:04.410
and false the next?

22:04.480 --> 22:06.210
Is she really Madam Yang or not?

22:13.900 --> 22:15.830
Just now Miss Rong strongly proved

22:15.880 --> 22:17.680
that Madam Yang was an imposter,

22:17.890 --> 22:19.030
all to help me draw the real culprit

22:19.030 --> 22:19.960
into our trap.

22:21.030 --> 22:23.270
Now that Madam Yang Yun is alive,

22:24.550 --> 22:26.350
all has been brought to light.

22:27.560 --> 22:28.360
Yang Jisheng!

22:28.720 --> 22:29.920
You falsely accuse Wei Kejian

22:29.920 --> 22:31.070
of killing his wife,

22:31.310 --> 22:32.970
and tried to kill the witness.

22:33.000 --> 22:34.860
Yet you show no remorse until now.

22:34.910 --> 22:36.110
To cover up the truth,

22:36.680 --> 22:38.590
you falsely accused
your own sister of prostitution.

22:38.590 --> 22:41.070
Your actions are despicable
and your heart is wicked.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.520
I have nothing more to say to you.

22:42.520 --> 22:44.710
Guards! Give him forty strokes first,

22:45.240 --> 22:46.760
before further questioning.

22:46.760 --> 22:47.200
Yes!

22:47.230 --> 22:49.090
That's exactly what he deserves!

22:49.870 --> 22:50.350
Move!

22:55.710 --> 22:56.230
Get up!

22:57.790 --> 22:58.260
Move!

23:11.590 --> 23:12.160
Beat him!

23:12.550 --> 23:13.680
Serves him right!

23:13.680 --> 23:14.830
Good!

23:14.910 --> 23:16.670
Father! Father!

23:16.920 --> 23:17.640
Step back!

23:17.960 --> 23:18.640
Stop!

23:18.660 --> 23:19.340
Get back!

23:19.370 --> 23:19.890
Aunt.

23:20.030 --> 23:21.070
Save him!

23:21.440 --> 23:22.000
Father!

23:22.830 --> 23:24.510
Stop it! Stop it!

23:25.150 --> 23:25.700
Father!

23:26.720 --> 23:27.750
Father!

23:32.640 --> 23:33.510
Aunt!

23:34.310 --> 23:36.070
Save him! Aunt!

23:36.590 --> 23:37.500
Aunt!

23:38.160 --> 23:38.750
Aunt!

23:39.680 --> 23:40.270
Father!

23:41.680 --> 23:43.790
Aunt, please save my father!

23:44.960 --> 23:45.830
Aunt!

23:46.480 --> 23:47.040
No!

23:48.640 --> 23:49.590
Father!

23:50.440 --> 23:51.680
Father!

23:53.860 --> 23:55.410
My Lord, have mercy!

23:56.520 --> 23:57.410
Father!

23:57.430 --> 23:58.430
Beat him to death!

24:06.550 --> 24:07.750
How dare you, Xu Song!

24:07.920 --> 24:09.160
Wei Kejian is clearly innocent,

24:09.160 --> 24:10.440
yet you fabricated charges against him.

24:10.440 --> 24:11.790
Yang Jisheng committed
unforgivable crimes,

24:11.790 --> 24:13.400
yet you spared him again and again.

24:13.400 --> 24:15.000
The Ministry of Justice
rejected the verdict,

24:15.000 --> 24:16.400
yet you dare to cover it up,

24:16.400 --> 24:17.160
deliberately obstruct justice,

24:17.160 --> 24:18.960
and treat a capital case
as if it were a game.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.200
According to our criminal law,

24:20.200 --> 24:22.070
any official who deliberately manipulates
another person's punishment

24:22.070 --> 24:24.790
shall be held fully responsible
for the entire offense.

24:24.790 --> 24:25.250
Guards!

24:25.720 --> 24:27.790
Strip him of his official hat and robe,

24:27.790 --> 24:29.030
and have him stand below
to await punishment!

24:29.030 --> 24:31.480
Lu Jianglai, how dare you!

24:31.830 --> 24:33.240
See if I dare or not.

24:33.300 --> 24:33.900
Seize him!

24:36.280 --> 24:36.800
Lord Lu.

24:37.200 --> 24:37.720
Lord Lu.

24:37.720 --> 24:38.860
We serve in the same court.

24:38.860 --> 24:39.350
You...

24:40.400 --> 24:41.590
Seize this corrupt official!

24:41.590 --> 24:42.790
Well judged, Lord Lu!

24:43.000 --> 24:44.070
Justice, my lord.

24:44.200 --> 24:45.440
This is justice for the people!

24:45.440 --> 24:46.640
Well judged, Lord Lu!

24:51.070 --> 24:56.000
Well judged!

24:56.160 --> 24:57.030
Well judged!

24:57.030 --> 24:58.030
Well judged!

24:58.030 --> 24:59.830
Well judged!

24:59.830 --> 25:01.160
Well done, Lord Lu!

25:31.000 --> 25:32.930
Old Madam, Miss Rong has returned,

25:33.110 --> 25:34.440
and is waiting outside.

25:34.640 --> 25:37.400
Did she win or lose?

25:38.000 --> 25:38.680
Old Madam.

25:38.960 --> 25:39.830
Lady Yunyin intercepted

25:39.830 --> 25:41.090
Lady Yunwan on the way.

25:41.440 --> 25:43.590
Lady Yunwan recognized
Madam Yang in court.

25:43.590 --> 25:45.520
It's not really Miss Rong's fault.

25:45.580 --> 25:47.310
Luckily, everything
was made clear publicly.

25:47.310 --> 25:49.110
Madam Yang herself is entirely innocent,

25:49.110 --> 25:50.290
and our Rong family's taking her in

25:50.290 --> 25:51.790
was an act of kindness and righteousness.

25:51.790 --> 25:53.160
What wrong was there in that?

25:53.160 --> 25:54.240
All sensible people outside

25:54.240 --> 25:55.400
praise you for being

25:55.400 --> 25:57.930
compassionate and protecting the innocent.

25:59.400 --> 26:01.660
What use is such a worthless reputation?

26:03.960 --> 26:06.620
Our Rong family has
long-standing principles.

26:06.720 --> 26:08.380
When dealing with gentlemen,

26:08.880 --> 26:11.920
we can be as close as we wish.

26:12.480 --> 26:14.340
But when it comes to petty people,

26:15.110 --> 26:16.640
we must be doubly cautious.

26:17.680 --> 26:20.550
The first rule is to keep harmony
at home and respect outside.

26:20.550 --> 26:22.790
In all matters, we should
endure and yield,

26:22.790 --> 26:24.720
and never act on momentary impulse.

26:24.720 --> 26:26.920
Publicly exposing a petty person's schemes

26:26.920 --> 26:27.590
will only invite

26:27.590 --> 26:29.510
endless resentment and revenge.

26:29.920 --> 26:31.110
The Wei family case

26:31.110 --> 26:32.910
remained unsolved for 10 years.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.680
Is Xu Song

26:35.110 --> 26:36.920
the only one involved?

26:37.510 --> 26:40.310
The reasons are far too deep to fathom.

26:40.600 --> 26:42.070
The honor she bears

26:43.350 --> 26:45.200
is not just her own.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.310
She's still too rash,

26:49.110 --> 26:51.040
lacking the wisdom of experience.

26:57.200 --> 26:58.060
Old Madam Rong.

26:58.790 --> 27:00.960
The autumn wind is rising,

27:01.400 --> 27:03.310
and Miss Rong has just
recovered from her illness.

27:03.310 --> 27:05.370
Should we have her come in to respond?

27:06.550 --> 27:07.240
You...

27:08.680 --> 27:09.480
What's wrong?

27:11.830 --> 27:14.480
Grandmother, it is all my fault.

27:15.270 --> 27:16.160
That day, Yunyin

27:16.160 --> 27:17.820
left the Flower Hall in haste,

27:18.880 --> 27:20.680
and didn't answer when I called her.

27:20.680 --> 27:21.830
She must have overheard

27:21.830 --> 27:22.440
how Shanbao

27:22.440 --> 27:23.790
dealt with Yunwan.

27:24.590 --> 27:26.860
If I had sensed
something was wrong sooner,

27:26.860 --> 27:28.400
we wouldn't have ended up with the sisters

27:28.400 --> 27:29.950
testifying against each other in court,

27:29.950 --> 27:32.210
forcing Shanbao to contradict herself.

27:32.750 --> 27:34.200
It is all my fault.

27:34.400 --> 27:36.020
I beg for your forgiveness, Grandmother.

27:36.020 --> 27:38.220
If she truly didn't want others to know,

27:38.310 --> 27:40.070
why would she speak of it aloud?

27:41.240 --> 27:43.500
She said it on purpose for Yunyin to hear.

27:44.240 --> 27:45.030
Well.

27:46.130 --> 27:48.260
She's deliberately going against me!

27:50.310 --> 27:51.110
Grandmother.

27:51.240 --> 27:53.040
You have nothing to do with this.

27:54.430 --> 27:56.550
Old Madam Rong, what about Miss Rong?

27:56.570 --> 27:57.700
Tell her to get lost!

28:22.540 --> 28:23.940
♪ Stars and the moon descended ♪

28:24.200 --> 28:29.350
♪ Falling Into the mortal world
to make flowers wither and hearts break ♪

28:29.490 --> 28:31.240
♪ How persistent ♪

28:31.260 --> 28:35.880
♪ How can such a fleeting grace
be forgotten? ♪

28:36.560 --> 28:38.380
♪ Beacon fires rose high ♪

28:38.400 --> 28:44.120
♪ With one more dance,
the music is over and people are gone ♪

28:45.440 --> 28:49.920
♪ We found another crescent moon ♪

28:47.200 --> 28:49.960
Miss Rong, for the sake of Madam Yang,

28:50.470 --> 28:51.200
you would dare

28:51.200 --> 28:52.920
to oppose Lady Rong, who loves you

28:52.920 --> 28:55.240
and make enemies
of all the officials in Linji.

28:55.240 --> 28:56.110
Is it worth it?

29:02.830 --> 29:04.720
Old Madam Rong has never been so angry

29:04.720 --> 29:06.240
in raising Miss Rong.

29:06.720 --> 29:08.580
If you truly care about Miss Rong,

29:09.830 --> 29:10.890
then don't meddle.

29:12.550 --> 29:14.880
The Rong family has always been peaceful.

29:16.920 --> 29:19.760
It's all that Lu Jianglai's fault
for causing trouble,

29:19.760 --> 29:21.760
upsetting Miss Rong, and making her

29:22.360 --> 29:24.420
fall out of favor with Old Madam Rong.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.320
He truly deserves to die.

29:27.920 --> 29:30.030
The Rong family has thrived
in Linji for many years.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.160
This requires a strong leader

29:31.160 --> 29:32.750
to keep officials in check,

29:33.310 --> 29:35.160
preserving outward harmony.

29:35.920 --> 29:37.680
To be the leader of the Rong family,

29:37.680 --> 29:39.210
one cannot be soft-hearted

29:39.240 --> 29:40.830
or put personal feelings above duty.

29:40.830 --> 29:42.690
Miss Rong is far too sentimental,

29:43.070 --> 29:45.400
which is Old Madam Rong's greatest taboo.

29:45.510 --> 29:48.960
Things are about to change
for the Rong family.

29:52.670 --> 29:53.310
Take Lady Yunyin

29:53.310 --> 29:55.070
back to the tea plantation immediately.

29:55.070 --> 29:57.270
Old Madam Rong refuses to see her again.

29:58.910 --> 29:59.640
Go now.

30:05.030 --> 30:05.480
Yes.

30:15.470 --> 30:16.870
♪ Stars and the moon descended ♪

30:17.240 --> 30:22.390
♪ Falling Into the mortal world
to make flowers wither and hearts break ♪

30:22.610 --> 30:24.360
♪ How persistent ♪

30:24.390 --> 30:29.000
♪ How can such a fleeting grace
be forgotten? ♪

30:29.480 --> 30:31.310
♪ Beacon fires rose high ♪

30:31.330 --> 30:37.040
♪ With one more dance,
the music is over and people are gone ♪

30:38.460 --> 30:42.940
♪ We found another crescent moon ♪

30:57.910 --> 30:59.810
♪ Hatred stretches far and wide ♪

30:59.830 --> 31:05.960
♪ One song severs the road to the ends
of the earth, nowhere to hide ♪

31:06.600 --> 31:11.690
♪ Could it be concealed
in the moonlight? ♪

31:18.830 --> 31:19.550
Master.

31:19.750 --> 31:20.270
Hurry up!

31:20.270 --> 31:21.880
Everyone, do not move!

31:22.440 --> 31:24.550
Anyone who moves will be
treated as an accomplice!

31:24.550 --> 31:26.270
Men on this side, women on that side.

31:26.270 --> 31:26.870
Separate!

31:27.720 --> 31:28.750
Search thoroughly.

31:28.750 --> 31:30.270
Record everything, item by item.

31:30.270 --> 31:31.330
Stop crying. Move!

31:31.550 --> 31:32.080
Hurry up!

31:32.510 --> 31:33.350
Hurry up!

31:33.590 --> 31:34.550
What are you looking at?

31:34.550 --> 31:35.010
Master.

31:35.510 --> 31:37.070
We searched the whole Yang family,

31:37.070 --> 31:39.000
yet Yang Yitang was nowhere to be found.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.270
According to the steward,

31:40.270 --> 31:41.200
several boxes of gold, pearls,

31:41.200 --> 31:42.350
and valuables kept in the storehouse

31:42.350 --> 31:43.480
have also vanished.

31:43.830 --> 31:46.000
The Yang family clearly
prepared a backup plan.

31:46.000 --> 31:48.460
Send out the orders.
Search the entire city.

31:53.680 --> 31:55.160
My Lord! My Lord! My Lord!

31:55.160 --> 31:56.440
I've been wronged, My Lord!

31:56.440 --> 31:57.070
I'm innocent, My Lord!

31:57.070 --> 31:58.270
I am innocent, My Lord.

31:58.270 --> 31:59.240
My Lord, I am innocent.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.160
I've been wronged, My Lord.

32:00.160 --> 32:01.890
My Lord! I'm innocent! My Lord!

32:04.960 --> 32:06.350
I'm truly innocent!

32:06.350 --> 32:07.640
I've been wronged!

32:07.640 --> 32:08.350
My Lord!

32:08.350 --> 32:09.270
Let me out!

32:09.270 --> 32:10.000
Who is him?

32:11.550 --> 32:12.110
My Lord.

32:12.480 --> 32:13.350
This man is the former magistrate

32:13.350 --> 32:14.950
of Tonglu County, Fan Wende.

32:16.830 --> 32:17.830
The trouble was that

32:17.830 --> 32:19.590
the presiding judge
back then, Fan Wende,

32:19.590 --> 32:20.720
was held up by a sudden rainstorm

32:20.720 --> 32:22.480
while rushing to repair
the collapsed houses,

32:22.480 --> 32:24.480
delaying the autopsy by three days.

32:24.720 --> 32:26.350
He insisted the evidence was insufficient,

32:26.350 --> 32:27.830
refused to
condemn Wei Kejian to death,

32:27.830 --> 32:29.590
and repeatedly defended Mrs. Wei,

32:29.590 --> 32:31.850
so he was punished for delaying the case.

32:32.070 --> 32:34.400
Good essay!

32:37.590 --> 32:39.190
Please let me out, My Lord.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.480
My Lord!

32:45.260 --> 32:47.440
My Lord, is there anything else you need?

32:47.440 --> 32:48.640
I can get more for you.

32:50.030 --> 32:51.680
This meat is a bit tough.

32:53.590 --> 32:55.190
Alright, I'll go swap it out.

33:04.830 --> 33:07.550
Prefect Xu, what an appetite you have.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.690
Are you enjoying your meal?

33:10.480 --> 33:11.480
Spare me, My Lord!

33:11.640 --> 33:13.300
Please spare my life, My Lord!

33:13.640 --> 33:14.270
What?

33:15.510 --> 33:16.440
Inspector Lu, did you come here

33:16.440 --> 33:18.100
just to kick me while I'm down?

33:18.750 --> 33:21.210
I'm here to add
another dish for you, Lord Xu.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.110
Serve it.

33:28.720 --> 33:29.520
The last meal?

33:31.190 --> 33:34.120
Lu Jianglai, you dare
sentence me to death?

33:34.200 --> 33:34.830
Xu Song.

33:36.030 --> 33:37.350
Yang Jisheng couldn't
withstand the torture

33:37.350 --> 33:38.620
and has confessed everything.

33:38.620 --> 33:40.160
You took bribes from the Yang family,

33:40.160 --> 33:41.830
forced Wei Kejian into a false confession,

33:41.830 --> 33:43.720
causing several deaths in the Wei family.

33:43.720 --> 33:45.070
Your actions have stirred public outrage

33:45.070 --> 33:46.050
and caused widespread fear.

33:46.050 --> 33:47.980
I sentence you to public beheading

33:48.940 --> 33:51.340
to appease the anger
of the people of Linji.

33:51.960 --> 33:53.020
You cannot kill me!

33:54.960 --> 33:58.240
You wouldn't dare!

34:00.000 --> 34:01.060
You wouldn't dare.

34:02.550 --> 34:03.610
You wouldn't dare.

34:05.070 --> 34:07.110
A last meal should be a generous one.

34:07.580 --> 34:09.310
Add more dishes for Lord Xu,

34:09.840 --> 34:11.440
in return for the many favors

34:11.500 --> 34:13.350
he once bestowed upon me.

34:13.710 --> 34:14.360
Yes.

34:22.590 --> 34:23.190
Lord Lu.

34:25.590 --> 34:26.230
Lord Lu.

34:28.070 --> 34:30.199
The Wei family case was far too serious

34:30.440 --> 34:31.840
to be decided by me alone.

34:32.800 --> 34:34.600
Now that I'm sentenced to death,

34:34.770 --> 34:36.800
I shouldn't be the only one to die for it.

34:36.800 --> 34:39.110
I've been wronged!

34:43.840 --> 34:45.070
Then by your account,

34:45.590 --> 34:47.230
who else has been involved?

34:47.800 --> 34:49.730
Who has escaped justice until now?

34:50.190 --> 34:50.670
It's...

34:52.150 --> 34:52.800
Who is it?

34:54.400 --> 34:54.920
It's...

34:59.070 --> 35:00.510
I cannot say.

35:01.360 --> 35:03.030
Don't force me.

35:05.440 --> 35:06.670
Who exactly is it?

35:07.800 --> 35:08.400
I want to hear you

35:08.400 --> 35:10.320
say his name yourself.

35:14.960 --> 35:17.370
Lord Lu, I cannot say.

35:18.630 --> 35:19.320
I can't.

35:21.230 --> 35:24.160
It would surely throw
the officialdom into turmoil.

35:25.030 --> 35:26.800
Even if I'm not sentenced to death,

35:26.800 --> 35:27.550
I won't walk

35:27.550 --> 35:28.550
out of here alive.

35:29.440 --> 35:33.150
I can't say it. I just can't.

35:34.110 --> 35:34.630
I...

35:39.230 --> 35:41.190
Open the door! Now!

35:45.190 --> 35:46.440
Xu Song! Xu Song!

35:46.960 --> 35:47.590
Call for help!

35:47.590 --> 35:48.150
Yes!

35:48.630 --> 35:50.440
This... this...

35:52.190 --> 35:54.320
It... it wasn't me.

35:55.030 --> 35:56.820
The food and wine
were sent by the Xu family.

35:56.820 --> 35:58.110
It has nothing to do with me!

35:58.110 --> 35:59.440
Nothing to do with me!

36:16.510 --> 36:19.150
The Wei family case has been resolved.

36:19.440 --> 36:22.000
Wei Kejian and the Wei family
are cleared of all charges

36:22.000 --> 36:23.280
and released.

36:23.920 --> 36:26.480
Yang Jisheng will be executed

36:26.840 --> 36:28.800
this autumn for the false accusation.

36:28.800 --> 36:31.030
Are you really not coming with me

36:31.340 --> 36:33.440
to report back to the capital?

36:34.000 --> 36:34.510
Master.

36:35.800 --> 36:36.510
In Linji, there are villains

36:36.510 --> 36:37.960
like Xu Song, who is corrupt,

36:37.960 --> 36:40.000
perverts the law, and acts reckless.

36:40.000 --> 36:41.960
But there are also many upright officials

36:41.960 --> 36:44.280
who would rather be imprisoned
than condemn the innocent.

36:44.280 --> 36:45.720
Several former magistrates
who upheld justice

36:45.720 --> 36:47.450
and were wrongfully convicted

36:47.760 --> 36:48.890
are still in prison,

36:49.150 --> 36:50.480
waiting to be released.

36:50.920 --> 36:52.480
Xu Song's constant evasions

36:52.480 --> 36:54.030
and concealments only prove

36:54.030 --> 36:56.230
how formidable the power behind him is.

36:56.280 --> 36:57.550
Without bringing him to justice,

36:57.550 --> 37:00.080
how can this case
truly be said to be resolved?

37:00.480 --> 37:02.010
I have submitted a memorial

37:02.150 --> 37:04.110
requesting to be appointed
as Prefect of Linji.

37:04.110 --> 37:05.480
I am determined to uphold integrity,

37:05.480 --> 37:06.540
purge corruption,

37:06.760 --> 37:08.710
and set the local officialdom right.

37:08.710 --> 37:09.590
Foolish!

37:10.320 --> 37:13.070
Absolute purity leaves
no room for survival.

37:13.440 --> 37:15.040
In the world of officialdom,

37:15.190 --> 37:18.510
there are many unavoidable compromises.

37:19.230 --> 37:22.960
When danger arises,
one should step back in time

37:23.230 --> 37:25.160
and wait for a better opportunity.

37:26.760 --> 37:28.090
I am stubborn by nature.

37:28.510 --> 37:30.760
I've never learned
the art of timely retreat.

37:30.760 --> 37:33.440
I know only how to advance
in the face of adversity.

37:33.440 --> 37:35.170
Please forgive my obstinance.

37:37.150 --> 37:39.110
You're young and impetuous.

37:39.590 --> 37:42.280
You will suffer greatly in the future.

37:44.070 --> 37:45.960
Please take care of your health, Master.

37:45.960 --> 37:47.760
Longjing tea in Linji
is at its best in early spring.

37:47.760 --> 37:48.960
You arrived a bit late

37:48.960 --> 37:49.760
and missed it.

37:50.880 --> 37:53.340
When you retire
and return to your hometown,

37:53.590 --> 37:55.510
your boat will still pass through Linji.

37:55.510 --> 37:56.280
At that time,

37:56.590 --> 37:58.400
I will bring the finest Longjing tea

37:58.400 --> 38:00.360
and wait for you at the dock.

38:01.920 --> 38:04.110
I fear that once I'm gone,

38:04.590 --> 38:06.230
the tea will soon grow cold.

38:07.190 --> 38:09.840
The winds on the river are strong
and the waves are high.

38:09.840 --> 38:13.070
Take good care of yourself.

38:20.590 --> 38:21.840
Come out now.

38:22.440 --> 38:23.760
You've followed me all this way.

38:23.760 --> 38:26.510
Did you really think I was unaware?

38:34.800 --> 38:35.400
Father.

38:38.440 --> 38:39.990
Greetings, Senior Lu.

38:44.630 --> 38:45.800
That's enough.

38:46.320 --> 38:47.110
Let's go.

39:05.280 --> 39:08.610
One should know the ways of the world
without being worldly,

39:08.880 --> 39:12.210
and grow sophisticated
while preserving one's innocence.

39:13.070 --> 39:16.070
If a young man lacks sharpness,

39:16.800 --> 39:18.670
he will never amount to much.

39:19.320 --> 39:21.190
If Lu Jianglai can overcome

39:22.230 --> 39:24.630
this obstacle,

39:25.760 --> 39:27.110
Ying,

39:27.670 --> 39:29.070
you will finally have

39:29.710 --> 39:32.030
someone to rely on for life.

39:34.000 --> 39:35.330
Father, once you leave,

39:35.590 --> 39:37.590
Senior Lu will lose all his backing.

39:38.000 --> 39:39.230
I'm truly curious.

39:39.760 --> 39:41.230
What skill does he have

39:41.800 --> 39:43.110
that could take down

39:43.510 --> 39:45.970
high-ranking officials single-handedly?

40:01.920 --> 40:03.780
Miss Rong, you're kind-hearted.

40:04.030 --> 40:05.030
Other than you,

40:06.110 --> 40:07.230
no one would ever come to see

40:07.230 --> 40:08.320
a cast-off woman.

40:09.440 --> 40:11.990
I've clung to
this wretched life for ten years.

40:11.990 --> 40:13.850
The Yang family members loathe me

40:15.170 --> 40:16.900
and seek to brand me as a wanton.

40:17.770 --> 40:19.520
I tried to vindicate Madam Wei,

40:20.150 --> 40:23.260
but the Wei family
didn't show the slightest gratitude.

40:23.260 --> 40:25.390
They only curse me as a venomous woman.

40:25.920 --> 40:27.760
Nowadays, everyone,

40:29.440 --> 40:31.000
even vegetable sellers

40:31.750 --> 40:33.610
calls me a harbinger of disaster.

40:34.720 --> 40:36.180
Miss Rong, who do you think

40:36.670 --> 40:37.840
I am now?

40:41.360 --> 40:42.110
Godmother.

40:43.440 --> 40:45.570
Why should you care about such gossip?

40:51.520 --> 40:54.850
I was carried into the Wei mansion
on an eight-bearer sedan.

40:55.360 --> 40:56.490
My arms once rivaled

40:57.450 --> 40:59.170
even the finest tribute silk.

41:00.280 --> 41:02.210
After marrying into the Wei family,

41:02.210 --> 41:03.810
I was only called Madam Yang.

41:04.320 --> 41:06.070
Now I'm called a loose woman,

41:06.400 --> 41:07.840
a venomous woman, a jinx.

41:08.670 --> 41:10.400
No one remembers my name.

41:11.670 --> 41:12.590
Miss Rong.

41:14.150 --> 41:15.480
My name is Yang Yun.

41:16.630 --> 41:17.670
From now on,

41:19.230 --> 41:21.000
I'll have no name or identity.

41:22.030 --> 41:23.110
Miss Rong.

41:23.550 --> 41:25.550
You need not worry about me anymore.

41:27.150 --> 41:29.210
I have already chosen where I will go.

41:33.350 --> 41:35.480
If you can live in peace and ease there,

41:36.360 --> 41:38.220
it can be a place for you to settle.

41:51.550 --> 41:52.610
I'm not going back!

41:52.750 --> 41:53.770
No one can force me!

41:53.770 --> 41:55.560
You're my only son.

41:56.230 --> 41:57.880
I had hoped you would
pass the imperial exam

41:57.880 --> 41:59.000
and bring honor to our family.

41:59.000 --> 41:59.840
But instead,

42:00.070 --> 42:02.630
you run off to the Rong family,
hoping to marry in.

42:02.630 --> 42:04.480
What a filial son you are.

42:04.880 --> 42:06.480
I've raised you for 20 years,

42:07.230 --> 42:07.920
and this is how

42:07.920 --> 42:08.960
you repay us?

42:10.360 --> 42:11.110
Father.

42:12.110 --> 42:13.360
I love Shanbao.

42:14.030 --> 42:15.950
I'm resolved to marry
into the Rong family.

42:15.950 --> 42:16.950
Mind your own business!

42:16.950 --> 42:18.720
You... you wayward son!

42:20.070 --> 42:21.000
Do you even know

42:21.000 --> 42:22.330
what the Rong family is?

42:22.710 --> 42:24.320
When Lady Rong turns cruel,

42:24.630 --> 42:26.830
she's worse than any man-eating demon!

42:26.960 --> 42:28.400
I should never have

42:28.400 --> 42:29.860
sent that bowl of meat soup

42:30.230 --> 42:32.070
and arranged that match.

42:32.150 --> 42:33.920
Yet you dare to rush headlong into this.

42:33.920 --> 42:35.450
You've got no fear of death!

42:37.320 --> 42:37.960
I actually don't know

42:37.960 --> 42:39.360
what our Rong family is.

42:40.000 --> 42:41.760
Why don't you tell me, Uncle?

42:43.000 --> 42:44.330
Miss Rong, you're here.

42:46.070 --> 42:47.960
I misspoke just now.

42:48.230 --> 42:49.960
Please don't take offense.

42:50.260 --> 42:50.990
-I…
-Enough.

42:52.030 --> 42:53.560
If Grandmother heard that,

42:54.320 --> 42:55.320
your carefree days

42:55.320 --> 42:56.760
would be over.

42:58.250 --> 42:59.050
Take him away.

43:00.340 --> 43:02.260
Okay. Let's go.

43:03.590 --> 43:04.390
Young Master.

43:08.070 --> 43:08.870
Young Master.

43:12.130 --> 43:14.130
Since I started doing these things,

43:14.240 --> 43:16.110
I knew it would hurt our relationship

43:16.110 --> 43:17.710
and damage your reputation.

43:19.070 --> 43:20.270
But I did them anyway.

43:22.070 --> 43:22.630
And

43:24.230 --> 43:25.800
I have no regrets.

43:26.800 --> 43:28.300
If you intend to drive me
out of the Rong family,

43:28.300 --> 43:30.100
there are some things I must say.

43:30.710 --> 43:32.170
Shanbao, others adore you

43:32.630 --> 43:34.360
for your beauty and wealth.

43:34.920 --> 43:36.380
But even if you were plain,

43:36.520 --> 43:37.890
and not a daughter of the Rong family,

43:37.890 --> 43:38.370
I...

43:41.480 --> 43:43.080
I would still be your cousin.

43:43.580 --> 43:45.180
Even without romantic ties,

43:45.500 --> 43:47.360
we still have our bond as cousins.

43:47.550 --> 43:48.880
I would never harm you.

43:50.410 --> 43:51.330
Go on.

43:54.860 --> 43:56.190
Not a single one of those

43:57.150 --> 43:59.750
who came to the Rong family
truly cared for you,

43:59.760 --> 44:01.420
especially that Lu Jianglai.

44:01.920 --> 44:04.550
You are so noble and proud,

44:05.150 --> 44:06.960
yet you exhaust yourself for him,

44:06.960 --> 44:08.360
damage your reputation,

44:08.810 --> 44:10.030
and estrange yourself from your family.

44:10.030 --> 44:11.030
It's not worth it.

44:11.800 --> 44:13.130
You've been determined

44:13.670 --> 44:15.530
to bring glory to the Rong Family.

44:15.550 --> 44:17.410
You are the brightest jewel of it.

44:17.880 --> 44:19.590
Everyone looks up to you.

44:20.760 --> 44:21.880
You shouldn't let a man

44:21.880 --> 44:22.680
hold you back.

44:27.140 --> 44:27.840
The whereabouts of Madam Yang

44:27.840 --> 44:29.490
were deliberately passed on to me.

44:29.490 --> 44:30.990
Someone in the Rong family
intends to harm you.

44:30.990 --> 44:32.120
You need to be ready.

47:05.450 --> 47:07.810
[Tea and Health]

47:19.120 --> 47:20.100
Ancient people drank tea

47:20.100 --> 47:21.690
primarily to refresh the mind.

47:21.450 --> 47:22.860
[Give yourself a cup of tea every day,
and let your body savor its benefits]

47:21.710 --> 47:22.950
One cup,

47:22.980 --> 47:24.580
and weariness would vanish.

47:24.710 --> 47:25.510
Scholars could then

47:25.510 --> 47:27.030
focus on their studies.

47:27.440 --> 47:29.590
In fact, tea has great benefits

47:29.590 --> 47:30.630
for human health.

47:30.980 --> 47:31.980
The Classic of Tea

47:32.000 --> 47:33.310
records its effects.

47:33.570 --> 47:36.160
If one feels heat and thirst,
mental heaviness, headache,

47:36.160 --> 47:37.700
eye strain, restlessness in the limbs,

47:37.700 --> 47:39.230
or stiffness in the joints,

47:39.250 --> 47:40.460
taking a few sips

47:40.490 --> 47:42.890
can rival the finest elixirs
and sweet dew.

47:43.760 --> 47:45.620
Modern scientific studies have shown that

47:45.620 --> 47:47.090
the polyphenols and catechins

47:47.090 --> 47:47.930
in green tea

47:48.030 --> 47:50.020
can significantly enhance the activity

47:50.020 --> 47:51.360
of superoxide dismutase,

47:51.360 --> 47:52.920
reduce oxidative damage,

47:53.000 --> 47:54.440
thereby slowing aging

47:54.520 --> 47:56.600
and preventing various chronic diseases.

47:56.600 --> 47:57.890
Tea polyphenols

47:57.920 --> 47:59.930
can absorb radioactive substances,

47:59.930 --> 48:01.600
reducing the harmful effects of radiation

48:01.600 --> 48:02.810
from electronic devices

48:02.810 --> 48:04.620
such as computers and mobile phones.

48:04.620 --> 48:06.200
Moreover, in regions where the diet

48:06.200 --> 48:08.160
is predominantly meat-based,

48:08.190 --> 48:09.750
tea is especially important.

48:09.750 --> 48:11.640
For example, in highland areas

48:11.670 --> 48:13.600
where people mainly consume beef,
mutton, and tsampa,

48:13.600 --> 48:14.450
drinking tea

48:14.470 --> 48:15.770
not only aids digestion

48:15.770 --> 48:16.630
but also maintains

48:16.630 --> 48:18.560
the body's acid-base balance,

48:18.590 --> 48:20.640
compensating for dietary deficiencies.

48:20.640 --> 48:22.340
That's why, thousands of years ago,

48:22.340 --> 48:23.400
tea had already become

48:23.400 --> 48:25.530
a vital commodity along
the Ancient Tea Horse Road.
